OL,3,GNEWSAA third of jail's inmates test
OL,4,Apositive for drugs
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne in three inmates at a prison in
OL,7,FSouth Yorkshire has tested positive for
OL,8,Fdrugs in the last year, according to an
OL,9,Finspection report.
OL,11,FThe Category C HMP Lindholme, near
OL,12,FDoncaster, which holds about 1,000 men,
OL,13,Fwas inspected without prior notice by
OL,14,FHM Chief Inspector of Prisons over
OL,15,Fseveral days in June.
OL,17,FThe "continuing availability and use of
OL,18,Fillicit drugs" at the jail was
OL,19,F"arguably the most pressing challenge"
OL,20,Ffaced there, according to a report
OL,21,Fwhich has just been published.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
